[
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0000",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "I-I think about this often, but—"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0001",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Nagato is pretty tough, isn't she?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0002",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "……"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0003",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "…Mikuru, are you feeling okay?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0004",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "W-why are you asking that?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0005",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "That came entirely out of the blue, and I don't\neven understand what you're trying to say."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0006",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "You got a fever or something?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0008",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "You have a fever, Mikuru?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0009",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "I-I don't, I don't—I'm in perfect health—"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0010",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Really? Well, if you insist…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0011",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "I guess you do have a point—Yuki certainly\nis pretty tough."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0012",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "R-right?!"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0013",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Rather, you could say the rest of the\nbrigade members are weak. Especially Kyon!"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0014",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "No matter what it is, he always complains\nabout how it's tiring and bothersome."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0016",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Yeah, Kyon's always like that~"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0017",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "As brigade chief, I think it's my duty to give\nhim some stern guidance."
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0018",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "I'll tell him to learn from Yuki. She always tries\nher best without any objections, right?"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0020",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "That's not what I wanted to talk about,\nthough…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0021",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "Waaa! I guess I really don't have talent for\nconversation…"
  },
  {
    "key": "evt_CN07S_0022",
    "original": "",
    "translation": "I'm sorry, Kyon…"
  }
]